# Implementation Plan - WindCast AI Full-Stack Production Integration

This document outlines the security specifications, data mapping, and connection architecture for linking the **Next.js frontend** and **FastAPI backend** utilizing **Firebase Authentication** and **Reconnecting WebSockets**.

---

## Centralized Integration Architecture

Our full-stack connection will follow a production-grade secure flow:

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Operator Client
    participant FE as Next.js Frontend
    participant FB as Firebase Auth Service
    participant BE as FastAPI Backend
    
    User->>FE: Logs in (Email/Password or Google)
    FE->>FB: Authentication handshake
    FB-->>FE: Returns Firebase ID Token
    FE->>FE: Store token in React Auth State
    
    User->>FE: Triggers Power Prediction Slider
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/predict with Bearer <ID_Token>
    BE->>BE: Intercept CORS Preflight (OPTIONS)
    BE->>FB: Verify token against Firebase Admin SDK
    FB-->>BE: Token Verified (Claims OK)
    BE->>BE: Execute ML Inference Pipeline
    BE-->>FE: JSON Response (Power, Efficiency, Alert)
    FE-->>User: Renders Neon Speedometer Dial
```

