## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Should the API client automatically refresh the Firebase ID Token when it detects an expired session (401 Unauthorized), or should it redirect the user to the Login page immediately?**
> *Our recommendation:* The API client in `src/services/api.ts` will first attempt to retrieve a fresh token from the active Firebase User session (`user.getIdToken(true)`). If Firebase Auth signals that the session has completely expired, the client will catch the 401 error, wipe local sessions, and redirect to `/login` with an "Auth Decryption Expired" toast notification.

